WEBVTT

00:14:00.407 --> 00:14:03.038
It's as simple as what I learned
to say to Alex.

00:14:03.062 --> 00:14:05.279
It's what I now have the privilege

00:14:05.303 --> 00:14:09.132
of saying to twentysomethings
like Emma every single day:

00:14:10.456 --> 00:14:14.118
Thirty is not the new 20,
so claim your adulthood,

00:14:14.142 --> 00:14:17.715
get some identity capital,
use your weak ties,

00:14:17.739 --> 00:14:19.364
pick your family.

00:14:20.106 --> 00:14:22.509
Don't be defined by what you didn't know

00:14:22.533 --> 00:14:23.601
or didn't do.

00:14:24.102 --> 00:14:26.684
You're deciding your life right now.

00:14:27.308 --> 00:14:28.318
Thank you.

00:14:28.342 --> 00:14:31.764
(Applause)